ary", "content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "world-famous"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "popular all over the world"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should try our world-famous chocolates!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about local traditions in a city."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tradition"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "beliefs or customs that people follow and practice"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Chocolate Week is a true San Francisco tradition!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "factory"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a building that produces items in large quantities"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to visit the Giovanelli Chocolate Factory."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stall"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small stand or booth for the sale of products in a large area"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many stalls filled with all kinds of chocolate."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "brand"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a name for a company that sells goods"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Giovanelli is my favorite chocolate brand."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to sample"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to try something in small quantities"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would like to sample different chocolate brands."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "source"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the place of origin"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You could sample our products straight from the source!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Tell me more!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I want to know more!"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Oh! Chocolate week! Tell me more!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I am so there!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I am definitely coming!"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A free visit to the Giovanelli Chocolate Factory? I am so there!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob06aud09"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le02ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Using Modals for Suggestions and Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use modals like <span class=\"italic\"> can, could, would</span> or <span class=\"italic\">should</span> when you make a suggestion or a polite request.<br><br>  You can reply to suggestions and requests with modals."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Asking</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What should we do tomorrow?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">When could we visit the factory?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Replying</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We could visit Chocolate Week!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You should take this form!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Customs and Traditions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Cities have different customs and traditions. In North America, people from different parts of the world bring their traditions and customs to the city they live in.<br><br>For example, cities like New York and San Francisco have a Chinatown, and a Little Italy. These are neighborhoods where people from China or Italy choose to live in and often celebrate traditions from their home countries.<br><br>In North America, it is very common to start a conversation with a stranger on the street. Remember to be polite!<br><br>"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of a local tradition in your city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "What kind of tradition is it? Is it about food? Culture? Religion?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the tradition and explain why you like it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 5-8 sentences. Include suggestion sentences for your partner to try the tradition."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph aloud to your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about local traditions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write 5-8 sentences explaining why I like the tradition."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my paragraph to my partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make suggestions about my city."}]}], "type": "sena"}